What is Shift I/O? This service helps you to send files to your PC or Laptop wireless, no Bluetooth or extra driver needed!

- Hit Start to start service.
- Copy and paste shown ip in the box.
- Use IP on any device in your network such as mobile phones or tablets to send files to your laptop or PC.

🔴 If you're using Windows, you may need to turn off your firewall or let access to ACD_Launcher.